== Notes ==
* {{i|Terra}}, along with any items that create rock waves like {{i|Mega Bean}} and {{i|Wait What?}} can destroy the Tuff Twins' armor.
* {{i|Sulfuric Acid}} tears cannot destroy their armor.
* Killing all the Bomb Grimaces with effects like {{i|Little Horn}} and {{i|Euthanasia}} can soft-lock Isaac in this fight.
* {{I|Plan C}} cannot kill the Tuff Twins if they still have their armor.

== Trivia ==
* They appear to be a rocky variation of Larry Jr.
* {{e|The Shell}} appears to be the posthumous version of them.
* Tuff is the name of a type of rock formed from volcanic ash.

